<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
	<Fixlet>
		<Title>BigFix Master Class -- Set CPU Utilization to 2% on Multi-Core Systems (1.0)</Title>
		<Description><![CDATA[
<STYLE>
.hc-wrap{font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;width:860px;padding:2px 2px 20px;color:#000032}
.hc-wrap FONT{font-size:13px !important;font-weight:400 !important}
.hc-eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1px;color:#17707f}
.hc-h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#000032;margin:2px 0 0}
.hc-rule{width:52px;height:3px;background:#17707f;margin:9px 0 12px;overflow:hidden}
.hc-lead{font-size:13px;color:#000032;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:12px;font-weight:400}
.hc-sec{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#000032;margin:13px 0 3px}
.hc-body{font-weight:400}
.hc-wrap UL{margin:2px 0 6px;padding-left:20px}
.hc-wrap LI{margin:1px 0;font-weight:400}
.hc-banner{margin-bottom:4px;border:1px solid #ebd3a8;background:#fcf6ea;padding:9px 12px}
.hc-bannerhd{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:bold;color:#8a5a00}
.hc-bcell{padding-left:9px}
.hc-bcell B{font-size:13px;color:#000032}
.hc-bcell SPAN{font-size:12px;color:#000032;display:block;line-height:1.3;font-weight:400}
</STYLE>

<DIV id=seed_2 class=hc-wrap>
<DIV class=hc-eyebrow>&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV class=hc-h1>Set CPU Utilization to 2% on Multi-Core Systems</DIV>
<DIV class=hc-rule style="HEIGHT: 3px; WIDTH: 851px">&nbsp;</DIV>
<DIV class=hc-lead><FONT color=#000000>Sets WorkIdle and SleepIdle on multi-core computers so the BigFix client uses about 2 percent of total CPU across all cores.</FONT></DIV>
<DIV class=hc-banner>
<DIV class=hc-bannerhd>READ BEFORE YOU RUN</DIV>
<TABLE style="WIDTH: 830px; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; TABLE-LAYOUT: fixed">
<TBODY>
<TR>
<TD style="WIDTH: 50%; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; PADDING-BOTTOM: 4px; PADDING-TOP: 3px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 12px">
<DIV class=hc-bcell style="BORDER-LEFT: #17707f 3px solid"><B>Master Operators only</B><SPAN>If SAML is enabled, use a local BigFix MO account.</SPAN></DIV></TD>
<TD style="WIDTH: 50%; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; PADDING-BOTTOM: 4px; PADDING-TOP: 3px; PADDING-LEFT: 12px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">
<DIV class=hc-bcell style="BORDER-LEFT: #17707f 3px solid"><B>Policy action, reapply daily</B><SPAN>Create it in the Master Action Site with dynamic targeting on All Computers.</SPAN></DIV></TD></TR>
<TR>
<TD style="WIDTH: 50%; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; PADDING-BOTTOM: 4px; PADDING-TOP: 3px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 12px">
<DIV class=hc-bcell style="BORDER-LEFT: #17707f 3px solid"><B>Runs where relevant</B><SPAN>Only on computers with more than one core where WorkIdle or SleepIdle differ from the target values.</SPAN></DIV></TD>
<TD style="WIDTH: 50%; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; PADDING-BOTTOM: 4px; PADDING-TOP: 3px; PADDING-LEFT: 12px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">
<DIV class=hc-bcell style="BORDER-LEFT: #17707f 3px solid"><B>WorkIdle capped at 100</B><SPAN>Above 10 cores WorkIdle stays at 100 so one core is not over allocated.</SPAN></DIV></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></DIV>
<DIV class=hc-body style="BORDER-TOP: #dce6f0 1px solid; MARGIN-TOP: 6px; PADDING-TOP: 8px">
<DIV class=hc-sec>Description</DIV>
<DIV style="FONT-SIZE: 14px; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 6px"><FONT color=#000000 size=2>The client works for WorkIdle milliseconds and then sleeps for SleepIdle milliseconds. The defaults of 10 and 480 target a single core. On one core the maximum agent CPU is 10 / (10 + 480), which is 2 percent. On four cores the same settings give 10 / ((10 + 480) * 4), which is 0.5 percent.</FONT></DIV>
<DIV style="FONT-SIZE: 14px"><FONT color=#000000 size=2>This task sets <TT>_BESClient_Resource_SleepIdle</TT> to 480 and <TT>_BESClient_Resource_WorkIdle</TT> to 10 times the number of cores. Above 10 cores WorkIdle is limited to 100. See <A href="https://help.hcl-software.com/bigfix/11.0/platform/Platform/Config/r_client_set.html">List of settings and Detailed Descriptions</A> for reference.</FONT></DIV>
<DIV class=hc-sec>Deployment Notes</DIV>
<UL>
<LI><FONT color=#000000 size=2>This task can only be run by Master Operators.</FONT> 
<LI><FONT color=#000000 size=2>Run this as a policy action created in the Master Action Site and the BigFix Management domain. Use the Dynamically target by property option and direct it at the All Computers group. Set it to reapply daily.</FONT> 
<LI><FONT color=#000000 size=2>BigFix 11.0.7 is expected to add a setting for CPU use on multi-core systems. Details are not yet available.</FONT> </LI>
</UL></DIV>
<DIV class=hc-sec>Supported Platforms</DIV>
<DIV style="FONT-SIZE: 14px"><FONT color=#000000 size=2>All BigFix client platforms with more than one CPU core.</FONT></DIV><BR>
<DIV class=hc-sec>Version and Release Notes</DIV>
<DIV style="FONT-SIZE: 14px"><FONT color=#000000 size=2>1.0 - Initial version.</FONT></DIV><script> document.body.ontakeaction = function(event) {
     if (event.contentID == 'Action1') {
         if (EvaluateRelevance('master flag of current console user') === "False") {
             alert('<?jxlat Only Master Operators can run this Task.?>');
             return false;
         }
     }
 }
</script> </DIV>]]></Description>
		<Relevance> (if exists property "in proxy agent context" then ( not in proxy agent context ) else true )</Relevance>
		<Relevance><![CDATA[(sum of cores of cpupackage as floating point) > 1]]></Relevance>
		<Relevance><![CDATA[(NOT (exists setting "_BESClient_Resource_WorkIdle" whose (exist value whose (it as string = (if ((sum of cores of cpupackage as floating point) > 10) then "100" else (((sum of cores of cpupackage as floating point) * 10) as integer as string)) ) of it)of client)) OR (NOT(((if (not exists setting "_BESClient_Resource_SleepIdle" of client OR not exists value of setting "_BESClient_Resource_SleepIdle" of client) then 480 else (value of setting "_BESClient_Resource_SleepIdle" of client as integer)) as floating point as integer) = 480))]]></Relevance>
		<Category>BigFix Master Class</Category>
		<DownloadSize>0</DownloadSize>
		<Source>HCL BigFix AVP and Professional Services</Source>
		<SourceID></SourceID>
		<SourceReleaseDate>2026-09-23</SourceReleaseDate>
		<SourceSeverity></SourceSeverity>
		<CVENames></CVENames>
		<SANSID></SANSID>
		<MIMEField>
			<Name>x-fixlet-modification-time</Name>
			<Value>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:44:29 +0000</Value>
		</MIMEField>
		<Domain>BES </Domain>
		<DefaultAction ID="Action1">
			<Description>
				<PreLink>Click </PreLink>
				<Link>here</Link>
				<PostLink> to deploy this action.</PostLink>
			</Description>
			<ActionScript MIMEType="application/x-Fixlet-Windows-Shell"><![CDATA[// If the number of cores are greater than 10, then set the value to 100, else  calculate the value as ((# of cores) * 10)
setting "_BESClient_Resource_WorkIdle"="{if ((sum of cores of cpupackage as floating point) > 10) then "100" else  (((sum of cores of cpupackage as floating point) * 10) as integer as string)}" on "{parameter "action issue date" of action}" for client 
setting "_BESClient_Resource_SleepIdle"="480" on "{parameter "action issue date" of action}" for client 
]]></ActionScript>
		</DefaultAction>
	</Fixlet>
</BES>
